      "id": "2122118297324056592",
      "text": "Seahawks win 21-13 to improve to 6-4. Defense allowed only 163 yards and sacked Fernando Mendoza six times. Drew Lock tossed two incredible TD passes. JSN went for another 171 yards with a TD. Seattle leaned on its run game (150 yards). Seattle has a bye, then the 49ers.",
