    {
      "id": "2122118012564365704",
      "text": "The defense sacked rookie Fernando Mendoza 6x, 2 by Devon Witherspoon But a record Jaxon Smith-Njigba Show just off The Strip won this game for the #Seahawks. His 6 catches, 144 yards in the 3rd is a new #Seahawks record for a single quarter. He called: Game over. How Seattle",
